{"id":"1a891abf5fe2909c","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-equivalence.md","title":"Equivalence Relation","display":"df-equivalence — Equivalence Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-equivalence","aliases":["58-df-equivalence"],"display":"df-equivalence — Equivalence Relation","depends_on":["[[58-df-binary-relation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-equivalence — Equivalence Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6d783b088eed1da1\" href=\"?note=6d783b088eed1da1\" title=\"58-df-binary-relation\">58-df-binary-relation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,R\\in V\">\\(A,R\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BinaryRelation}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{BinaryRelation}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6d783b088eed1da1\" href=\"?note=6d783b088eed1da1\" title=\"58-df-binary-relation\">58-df-binary-relation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Refl},\\operatorname{Sym},\\operatorname{Trans},\\operatorname{Equiv}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{Refl},\\operatorname{Sym},\\operatorname{Trans},\\operatorname{Equiv}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6d783b088eed1da1\" href=\"?note=6d783b088eed1da1\" title=\"58-df-binary-relation\">58-df-binary-relation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Reflexive},\\mathrm{Symmetric},\\mathrm{Transitive},\\mathrm{EquivRel}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Reflexive},\\mathrm{Symmetric},\\mathrm{Transitive},\\mathrm{EquivRel}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}reflexive} \\vdash \\mathrm{Reflexive}(R,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BinaryRelation}_S(R,A,A)\\land\\operatorname{Refl}(R,A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}reflexive} \\vdash \\mathrm{Reflexive}(R,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BinaryRelation}_S(R,A,A)\\land\\operatorname{Refl}(R,A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}symmetric} \\vdash \\mathrm{Symmetric}(R,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BinaryRelation}_S(R,A,A)\\land\\operatorname{Sym}(R,A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}symmetric} \\vdash \\mathrm{Symmetric}(R,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BinaryRelation}_S(R,A,A)\\land\\operatorname{Sym}(R,A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}transitive} \\vdash \\mathrm{Transitive}(R,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BinaryRelation}_S(R,A,A)\\land\\operatorname{Trans}(R,A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}transitive} \\vdash \\mathrm{Transitive}(R,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BinaryRelation}_S(R,A,A)\\land\\operatorname{Trans}(R,A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{EquivRel}(R,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BinaryRelation}_S(R,A,A)\\land\\operatorname{Equiv}(R,A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{EquivRel}(R,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BinaryRelation}_S(R,A,A)\\land\\operatorname{Equiv}(R,A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-binary-relation","status":"resolved","id":"6d783b088eed1da1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-binary-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-binary-relation","status":"resolved","id":"6d783b088eed1da1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,R\\in V$ and $\\mathrm{BinaryRelation}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[58-df-binary-relation]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-binary-relation","status":"resolved","id":"6d783b088eed1da1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Refl},\\operatorname{Sym},\\operatorname{Trans},\\operatorname{Equiv}\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[58-df-binary-relation]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BinaryRelation}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Refl},\\operatorname{Sym},\\operatorname{Trans},\\operatorname{Equiv}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Reflexive},\\mathrm{Symmetric},\\mathrm{Transitive},\\mathrm{EquivRel}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}reflexive} \\vdash \\mathrm{Reflexive}(R,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BinaryRelation}_S(R,A,A)\\land\\operatorname{Refl}(R,A)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}symmetric} \\vdash \\mathrm{Symmetric}(R,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BinaryRelation}_S(R